## Methods (Week 3 notes): binomial GLM with logit link, odds ratios,
## Wald tests, deviance, likelihood ratio (drop-in-deviance) tests,
## profile-likelihood and Wald CIs for odds ratios.
##
## Part A: player injury (league_players.csv), binary response `injured`
## Part B: Ashford match wins (ashford_matches.csv), derived binary `win`
